            <ArticleTitle>Reversible central pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>271-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report two cases of central pain which receded completely after treatment of the inciting lesion. These cases highlight the intrinsic reversibility of central pain and the focal nature of central pain mechanisms.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
